tracking feature","messageBody":"Add support for recording run timing data for athletes. This feature allows coaches to log training performance for a specific athlete using the command:\n\naddtiming INDEX dist/DISTANCE min/MINUTES sec/SECONDS\n\nKey changes:\n- Added RunTiming model class to represent distance and time records\n- Extended Person model to store a list of RunTiming entries\n- Implemented AddTimingCommand to handle timing insertion\n- Implemented AddTimingCommandParser to parse CLI inputs\n- Added CLI prefixes dist/, min/, sec/ for timing parameters\n- Updated AddressBookParser to register the addtiming command\n- Extended JsonAdaptedPerson to support serialization of run timings\n- Added JsonAdaptedRunTiming to support Jackson persistence\n\nTimings are now stored in memory and persisted to the addressbook JSON file, allowing timing records to survive application restarts.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":219,"deletions":56}}},{"hash":"a9de99a55dbdf00f1ea4fee844d46f30dfe46e9d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Allow viewathlete to view run timings","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":27,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"24ec235f9f0f01c3331c1bbd5f49e31dc39ee59e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix print format","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":50,"deletions":32}}}]},{"date":"2026-03-12T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"db1493345c64544be5dec3f05ca1ec9efcf1f5c2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix personal best run times","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":9,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"6afaab368a7f1df94115eeef4a5326dee68cbfa9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix bug for minus time and error msg","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":35,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"b410889a399821c1c7629d4dcf6106c0a8c6ee78","isMergeCommit":false,"message